Module demo.decimal_int_match.

Rule classify given x, produce Text:
  Match x:
    When 0, Return "zero".
    When 1, Return "one".
    When other, Return "other".

Rule decimalZero produce Text:
  Return classify(0m).

Rule decimalZeroScaled produce Text:
  Return classify(0.00m).

Rule decimalOneScaled produce Text:
  Return classify(1.000m).

Rule decimalOnePointFive produce Text:
  Return classify(1.5m).

Rule intOne produce Text:
  Return classify(1).
